#: ../../site/contributing.md:1
msgid "Contributing to code and documentation"
msgstr "参与代码与文档贡献"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:3
msgid "Before you start"
msgstr "开始之前"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:5
msgid ""
"Open an issue for anything larger than a bug fix or a documentation "
"correction, so scope is agreed before you spend time on it. Security reports"
" go through `SECURITY.md`, never a public issue. Small, focused pull "
"requests are reviewed faster than large ones."
msgstr ""
"对于任何大于缺陷修复或文档订正的工作，请先开 issue，以便在投入时间前确认范围。安全问题走 `SECURITY.md`，绝不开公开 "
"issue。小而聚焦的 pull request 比大块改动更快得到评审。"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:10
msgid "Code changes"
msgstr "代码变更"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:12
msgid "Build and run the full suite, then add targeted tests for new behaviour:"
msgstr "构建并运行完整测试套件，然后为新行为补充针对性测试："

#: ../../site/contributing.md:14
msgid ""
"cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release\n"
"cmake --build build --parallel\n"
"ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure\n"
msgstr ""
"cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release\n"
"cmake --build build --parallel\n"
"ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure\n"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:20
msgid "Rules that reviewers check:"
msgstr "评审者会检查的规则："

#: ../../site/contributing.md:22
msgid ""
"Public signatures and contracts stay explicit; a new public declaration "
"needs a comment, a Chinese translation and a refreshed API ledger in the "
"same change."
msgstr "公共签名与契约保持显式；新增公共声明必须在同一次改动里带上注释、中文翻译与刷新后的 API 清单。"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:24
msgid ""
"A numeric change comes with the fixture or oracle that justifies it. Do not "
"weaken an assertion or loosen a tolerance to make a platform pass."
msgstr "数值改动必须附带能说明它的 fixture 或 oracle。不要为了让某个平台通过而削弱断言或放宽容差。"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:26
msgid ""
"A performance change states its workload, machine and statistic; a noisy "
"result is recorded as INCONCLUSIVE rather than summarised upward."
msgstr "性能改动要说明负载、机器与统计量；噪声结果记为 INCONCLUSIVE，而不是向上汇总。"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:28
msgid ""
"Optional surfaces (ImPlot, extensions) stay optional: no core target may "
"start depending on a GUI library."
msgstr "可选接口（ImPlot、扩展）保持可选：任何核心 target 都不得开始依赖图形库。"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:31
msgid "Comment standard"
msgstr "注释规范"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:33
msgid ""
"Public declarations use `///` Google-style contracts: a verb phrase such as "
"\"Returns ...\", units, alignment and missing-value rules, ownership, and "
"verified failure modes. Implementation comments explain non-obvious "
"algorithms and invariants, not line-by-line mechanics. Do not invent "
"complexity, thread-safety or exception guarantees."
msgstr ""
"公共声明使用 `///` 的 Google 风格契约：以“Returns "
"...”这类动词短语开头，写明单位、对齐与缺失值规则、所有权，以及经过验证的失败模式。实现注释解释不明显的算法与不变量，而不是逐行复述机械步骤。不要臆造复杂度、线程安全或异常保证。"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:39
msgid "A comment-only change must be provably comment-only:"
msgstr "纯注释改动必须可证明是纯注释："

#: ../../site/contributing.md:41
msgid "python docs/site/tools/check_comment_only.py <files>\n"
msgstr "python docs/site/tools/check_comment_only.py <files>\n"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:45
msgid "Documentation changes"
msgstr "文档变更"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:47
msgid ""
"The English source is authoritative. Generate the catalogs, translate the "
"new strings, then build both languages with strict warnings:"
msgstr "英文源是权威。先生成目录、翻译新字符串，再用严格警告构建两种语言："

#: ../../site/contributing.md:50
msgid ""
"cd docs/site\n"
"doxygen Doxyfile\n"
"python tools/normalize_doxygen_xml.py ../_build/doxygen/xml\n"
"sphinx-build -b gettext -W --keep-going . ../_build/gettext\n"
"sphinx-intl update -p ../_build/gettext -l zh_CN\n"
"sphinx-build -b html -W -n --keep-going . ../_build/html/en\n"
"FINCORE_DOCS_LANGUAGE=zh_CN sphinx-build -b html -W -n --keep-going . "
"../_build/html/zh_CN\n"
"cd ../..\n"
"python docs/site/tools/check_built_site.py\n"
msgstr ""
"cd docs/site\n"
"doxygen Doxyfile\n"
"python tools/normalize_doxygen_xml.py ../_build/doxygen/xml\n"
"sphinx-build -b gettext -W --keep-going . ../_build/gettext\n"
"sphinx-intl update -p ../_build/gettext -l zh_CN\n"
"sphinx-build -b html -W -n --keep-going . ../_build/html/en\n"
"FINCORE_DOCS_LANGUAGE=zh_CN sphinx-build -b html -W -n --keep-going . "
"../_build/html/zh_CN\n"
"cd ../..\n"
"python docs/site/tools/check_built_site.py\n"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:62
msgid "Documentation rules that are enforced, not suggested:"
msgstr "会被强制执行的文档规则："

#: ../../site/contributing.md:64
msgid ""
"Every page has a Chinese entry in `locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/`; untranslated "
"or fuzzy entries fail the site check."
msgstr "每个页面在 `locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/` 都有中文条目；未翻译或 fuzzy 条目会让站点检查失败。"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:66
msgid ""
"A heading must not start with a number (`## 1. ...`), or MyST leaves it "
"untranslated even when the catalog has the string."
msgstr "标题不得以数字开头（`## 1. ...`），否则即使目录里有该字符串，MyST 也会让它保持未翻译。"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:68
msgid "Identifiers, commands, paths and formulas stay literal in the translation."
msgstr "标识符、命令、路径与公式在翻译中保持原样。"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:69
msgid ""
"Generated HTML, Doxygen XML, `.pot`/`.mo` files and benchmark outputs stay "
"out of git."
msgstr "生成的 HTML、Doxygen XML、`.pot`/`.mo` 文件与基准输出不入库。"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:71
msgid ""
"A page that describes a failure mode names the real message, not a "
"paraphrase."
msgstr "描述失败模式的页面要写出真实消息，而不是转述。"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:73
msgid "Commits and pull requests"
msgstr "提交与 pull request"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:75
msgid ""
"One topic per commit: behaviour, documentation, and generated-artifact "
"updates do not share a commit."
msgstr "一次提交一个主题：行为改动、文档改动与产物更新不放在同一提交里。"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:77
msgid ""
"Say what you ran and what you could not verify — platform, hardware, "
"external service. A local build is not an online deployment."
msgstr "说明你跑了什么、以及没能验证什么 —— 平台、硬件、外部服务。本地构建不等于线上部署。"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:79
msgid ""
"If a platform is unavailable, record it as pending with the exact flip path "
"instead of claiming success."
msgstr "若某个平台不可用，请连同确切的操作路径一起记为待完成，而不是声称成功。"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:82
msgid "Review and evidence"
msgstr "评审与证据"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:84
msgid ""
"Reviewers look for: the contract is stated where a reader will look for it; "
"the test would fail if the behaviour regressed; the documentation says what "
"the code does rather than what it was intended to do; and any number that "
"appears in prose can be reproduced from the repository."
msgstr "评审者关注：契约写在读者会去找的位置；如果行为回退，测试会失败；文档写的是代码实际做什么而不是打算做什么；文中出现的每个数字都能从仓库复现。"

#: ../../site/contributing.md:89
msgid ""
"Acceptance records under `docs/acceptance/` and iteration notes under "
"`docs/iterations/` are the project's memory. Update them when a change "
"alters what is true, and never rewrite history to look cleaner than it was."
msgstr ""
"`docs/acceptance/` 下的验收记录与 `docs/iterations/` "
"下的迭代说明是项目的记忆。当改动改变了事实时更新它们，绝不为了看起来更整洁而改写历史。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Keep behavior changes, documentation-only "
#~ "changes and generated-artifact updates in"
#~ " separate commits. Record the actual "
#~ "commit, checks and exceptions; do not "
#~ "cite a local build as an online "
#~ "deployment."
#~ msgstr "将行为变更、仅文档变更和生成产物更新放在不同的提交中。记录实际提交、检查项和例外情况；不要把本地构建说成在线部署。"

